## Why This Is Asked
This angle tests practical integration of real-time UX with common Azure PaaS: static hosting, serverless APIs, scalable data, and live updates, plus governance and disaster recovery.

## Key Concepts
- Azure Static Web Apps with SPA routing
- Azure Functions (Consumption) as API layer
- Cosmos DB SQL API as scalable data store
- Azure SignalR Service for real-time client updates
- Azure Entra ID for authentication
- Azure Front Door with TLS termination
- GitHub Actions for CI/CD
- Resource tagging and cost budgeting
- Cross-region DR for Cosmos DB

## Code Example
```javascript
// Example: Azure Function (JavaScript) emitting a SignalR update
module.exports = async function (context, req) {
  const update = { orderId: req.params.id, status: req.body.status };
  context.bindings.signalRMessages = [{
    target: 'orderUpdated',
    arguments: [ update ]
  }];
  context.res = { status: 200 };
};
```

